{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/976e7444e9a8ec42d139815047330509.poster.avif?t=1755401013\" width=750 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/976e7444e9a8ec42d139815047330509.webm?t=1755401013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/976e7444e9a8ec42d139815047330509.mp4?t=1755401013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alpha Point is a next-generation, solo-indie masterpiece: a realistic, competitive multiplayer FPS packed with action, grit, and community...</strong><i>Whew,</i> that's a lot of adjectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/6c94a107af90e049611dd87a944c927c.poster.avif?t=1755401013\" width=750 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/6c94a107af90e049611dd87a944c927c.webm?t=1755401013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/6c94a107af90e049611dd87a944c927c.mp4?t=1755401013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Ray-Traced Graphics:</strong> Experience cutting-edge visuals with highly optimized ray tracing, delivering lifelike lighting and reflections on a solo-indie budget.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Movement &amp; Gunplay:</strong>\u00a0Master intuitive mechanics with responsive shooting, nostalgic movement, and tactical sprinting for never-ending, heart-pounding action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Rank &amp; Loadout System:</strong> Climb ranks through skill, earn Tags to unlock weapons and characters, or risk your status to Prestige for the boost you deserve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Gameplay Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Free-For-All:</strong></i> Eliminate every rival in sight. Be the last man standing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Team Deathmatch:</strong></i> Team up to outgun the enemy. Coordination is your edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Capture the Flag:</strong></i> Steal the enemy flag while defending your own. Strategy is key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With more on the way...</i></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Unique Maps:</strong> Battle across meticulously crafted arenas designed for intense firefights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ten Distinct Weapons:</strong> From assault rifles to snipers to shotguns, customize the loadout that suits you best.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Voice Chat:</strong> Strategize with teammates and taunt foes in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robust Anti-Cheat:</strong> Non-intrusive protection built into the code itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Bartholomew...</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/842979152426d2b9a4c746886ca504a4.poster.avif?t=1755401013\" width=750 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/842979152426d2b9a4c746886ca504a4.webm?t=1755401013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/842979152426d2b9a4c746886ca504a4.mp4?t=1755401013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The times of war are upon us, and the Alpha Squad needs you. Win matches to rise through the ranks, earn Tags to unlock new gear, or Prestige to further your glory at the risk of losing it all. Beware: One wrong move could bankrupt your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/db52c7bb21b4c39377dd3afed39870a4.poster.avif?t=1755401013\" width=1242 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/db52c7bb21b4c39377dd3afed39870a4.webm?t=1755401013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/db52c7bb21b4c39377dd3afed39870a4.mp4?t=1755401013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built by a passionate solo developer, Alpha Point is a living project shaped by community feedback, with additional planned content already coming your way. Join the fight, wishlist now, and head to the Alpha Point -- your squad is calling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3928680?t=1755401013","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/ba62b8dadd4ccbe4957f25877b83c78e623c764b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755401013","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/964bd11578c9122a4d0e9e9a69bb97ba109e8d0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755401013","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/964bd11578c9122a4d0e9e9a69bb97ba109e8d0f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755401013","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains blood, simulated character death (ragdolls), firearms, depictions of war, and general violence."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/976e7444e9a8ec42d139815047330509.poster.avif?t=1755401013\" width=750 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/976e7444e9a8ec42d139815047330509.webm?t=1755401013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/976e7444e9a8ec42d139815047330509.mp4?t=1755401013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alpha Point is a next-generation, solo-indie masterpiece: a realistic, competitive multiplayer FPS packed with action, grit, and community...</strong><i>Whew,</i> that's a lot of adjectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/6c94a107af90e049611dd87a944c927c.poster.avif?t=1755401013\" width=750 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/6c94a107af90e049611dd87a944c927c.webm?t=1755401013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/6c94a107af90e049611dd87a944c927c.mp4?t=1755401013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Ray-Traced Graphics:</strong> Experience cutting-edge visuals with highly optimized ray tracing, delivering lifelike lighting and reflections on a solo-indie budget.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Movement &amp; Gunplay:</strong>\u00a0Master intuitive mechanics with responsive shooting, nostalgic movement, and tactical sprinting for never-ending, heart-pounding action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Rank &amp; Loadout System:</strong> Climb ranks through skill, earn Tags to unlock weapons and characters, or risk your status to Prestige for the boost you deserve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Gameplay Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Free-For-All:</strong></i> Eliminate every rival in sight. Be the last man standing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Team Deathmatch:</strong></i> Team up to outgun the enemy. Coordination is your edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Capture the Flag:</strong></i> Steal the enemy flag while defending your own. Strategy is key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With more on the way...</i></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Unique Maps:</strong> Battle across meticulously crafted arenas designed for intense firefights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ten Distinct Weapons:</strong> From assault rifles to snipers to shotguns, customize the loadout that suits you best.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Voice Chat:</strong> Strategize with teammates and taunt foes in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robust Anti-Cheat:</strong> Non-intrusive protection built into the code itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Bartholomew...</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/842979152426d2b9a4c746886ca504a4.poster.avif?t=1755401013\" width=750 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/842979152426d2b9a4c746886ca504a4.webm?t=1755401013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/842979152426d2b9a4c746886ca504a4.mp4?t=1755401013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The times of war are upon us, and the Alpha Squad needs you. Win matches to rise through the ranks, earn Tags to unlock new gear, or Prestige to further your glory at the risk of losing it all. Beware: One wrong move could bankrupt your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/db52c7bb21b4c39377dd3afed39870a4.poster.avif?t=1755401013\" width=1242 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/db52c7bb21b4c39377dd3afed39870a4.webm?t=1755401013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/extras/db52c7bb21b4c39377dd3afed39870a4.mp4?t=1755401013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built by a passionate solo developer, Alpha Point is a living project shaped by community feedback, with additional planned content already coming your way. Join the fight, wishlist now, and head to the Alpha Point -- your squad is calling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["C4W Game Studios, LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928680/bc17ed3e694cece094cd4927ef38f558f708a218/header.jpg?t=1755401013","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 C4W Game Studios, LLC. All rights reserved.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlpha Point uses Unreal\u00ae Engine. Unreal\u00ae is a trademark or registered <br />\r\ntrademark of Epic Games, Inc. in the United States of America and elsewhere.<br />\r\nUnreal\u00ae Engine, Copyright 1998 \u2013 2025, Epic Games, Inc. All rights reserved.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlpha Point uses NVIDIA DLSS.<br />\r\nNVIDIA DLSS is a trademark of NVIDIA Corporation.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257178240,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178240/movie480.mp4?t=1754921256","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178240/movie_max.mp4?t=1754921256"},"name":"Alpha Point Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257178240/e3836ac50f14643c0cda97e68d1531d2b26576f0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754921256","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178240/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754921256","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178240/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754921256"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257180620,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180620/movie480.mp4?t=175502